This licence covers the code in this repository: the data fetchers, the
benchmark harness, the analysis and figure scripts, and the paper source.

It does NOT cover the observations those fetchers retrieve. This repository
distributes no data. Each source is downloaded directly from its publisher at
run time, and that publisher's own terms govern reuse of its data:

  Wikimedia pageviews        Wikimedia REST API
  Weather and air quality    Open-Meteo (ERA5 and CAMS archives)
  Electricity                Energinet, Energi Data Service
  Exchange rates             European Central Bank SDMX API
